{"id":"b3-u08","level":"b3","order":8,"title":{"en":"Shopping and requests","fr":"Les achats et les demandes","es":"Compras y peticiones","ar":"التسوق والطلبات"},"tip":{"en":"Be polite: 'Can I...?' asks permission, 'Could you...?' asks for help, and 'I would like...' says what you want. Add 'please' and 'thank you'.","fr":"Soyez poli : « Puis-je... ? » demande la permission, « Pourriez-vous... ? » demande de l'aide, et « Je voudrais... » dit ce que vous désirez. Ajoutez « s'il vous plaît » et « merci ».","es":"Sé amable: «¿Puedo...?» pide permiso, «¿Podría...?» pide ayuda y «Quisiera...» dice lo que quieres. Añade «por favor» y «gracias».","ar":"كن مؤدبا: «هل يمكنني...؟» لطلب الإذن، و«هل يمكنك...؟» لطلب المساعدة، و«أود...» لقول ما تريد. وأضف «من فضلك» و«شكرا»."},"words":36,"lessons":[{"id":"b3-u08-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"shop, supermarket, cashier","fr":"magasin, supermarché, caissier","es":"tienda, supermercado, cajero","ar":"متجر، سوبرماركت، أمين الصندوق"},"count":11},{"id":"b3-u08-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"cheap, expensive, discount","fr":"bon marché, cher, réduction","es":"barato, caro, descuento","ar":"رخيص، غال، خصم"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u08-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"wallet, trousers, size","fr":"portefeuille, pantalon, taille","es":"cartera, pantalón, talla","ar":"محفظة، بنطال، مقاس"},"count":11},{"id":"b3-u08-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"to buy, to sell, to cost","fr":"acheter, vendre, coûter","es":"comprar, vender, costar","ar":"يشتري، يبيع، يكلف"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u08-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"card, change, to show","fr":"carte, monnaie, montrer","es":"tarjeta, cambio, enseñar","ar":"بطاقة، الباقي، يري"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u08-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"to bring, to open, to close","fr":"apporter, ouvrir, fermer","es":"traer, abrir, cerrar","ar":"يحضر، يفتح، يغلق"},"count":9},{"id":"b3-u08-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"thank you, could you, can I","fr":"merci, pourriez-vous, puis-je","es":"gracias, podría, puedo","ar":"شكرا، هل يمكنك أن، هل يمكنني"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u08-l8","type":"learn","order":8,"title":{"en":"another, bigger, smaller","fr":"un autre, plus grand, plus petit","es":"otro, más grande, más pequeño","ar":"آخر، أكبر، أصغر"},"count":9},{"id":"b3-u08-l9","type":"story","order":9,"title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u08-l10","type":"review","order":10,"title":{"en":"Unit review","fr":"Révision de l'unité","es":"Repaso de la unidad","ar":"مراجعة الوحدة"},"count":9}]}
